  "description": "Who Did I Go on a Blind Date With? Han Bom is a first-year surgical resident at YJ Hospital. Though momentarily taken aback by the rugged, wild charm of the man she’s been set up with, she sticks to her plan and turns him down. Having accomplished what she came for, Bom is about to leave when she sees someone collapse at the hotel. She rushes to help and ends up saving the person together with her blind date…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70234407/), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%B0%A9%EA%B0%81-%EB%A7%9E%EC%84%A0/4957)",
